  cursor draws no local options: cursor-agent cannot target a custom endpoint
  (its --endpoint picks a Cursor backend; open feature request
  forum.cursor.com/t/cursor-cli-custom-endpoint-and-api-key-support/129424).
  SPEC: _spec/defs/hermes/hermes-paradigm.puml
